6. **Log out** (Step 9): `az logout` (the active account: this login), then `az account list` holds no entry of this login (`LOGGED-OUT: PASS`). The cached state lives only in `<azcfg>`, under `<project>/4_Credentials/`, which `<project>/.gitignore:4` ignores (`4_Credentials/`, MEASURED); **`git check-ignore` cannot run there and you say why: `<project>` is not a git repository (MEASURED: `git -C '<project>' rev-parse --show-toplevel` rc 128), and the only repository, `<project>/2_Project_Files`, does not contain `4_Credentials/`.**
